    "chunk_text": "os blostm, floris; Sume syndon FEMININI GENERIS: haec dos \u00f0eos brydgyfu, huius dotis; haec cos \u00f0es hwetstan, Sume synd COMMVNIA: hic et haec custos \u00fees and \u00f0eos hyrde, huius custodis; compos wilf\u00e6gen, Ne g\u00e6\u00f0 nan o\u00f0er nama on \u00f0as wisan. An nama her is NEVTRI GENERIS: hoc os \u00fees mu\u00f0, huius oris. And ealle \u00feas naman habba\u00f0 langne o on gebigedum casum, buton compos and inpos. IN VS CORREPTAM. On scortne us geendia\u00f0 \u00feas naman: hic lepus \u00fees hara, huius leporis; hic et haec et hoc uetus loc, \u00de\u00e6t is eac NEVTRI GENERIS: hoc pecus, huius pecoris. \u00deas o\u00f0re sind NEVTRI GENERIS: hoc opus \u00feis weorc, huius operis; hoc uellus \u00feis flys, huius Ealswa ga\u00f0 \u00feas: uiscus inno\u00f0, uisceris; pondus byr\u00f0en o\u00f0\u00f0e w\u00e6ge, ponderis; holus wyrt, holeris; Sume habba\u00f0 scortne o: tempus tima, temporis; timpus \u00feunwencge, timporis; litus strand, litoris; IN VS PRODVCTAM. On langne us geendia\u00f0 \u00feas naman: hic mus \u00feeos mus, huius muris; COMMVNIA: hic et haec sus Ealswa crus sceanca, cruris; ius lagu, iuris; plus mare, pluris; and ealle \u00f0as habba\u00f0 langne u on Is eac to witenne, \u00fe\u00e6t plus is NEVTRI GENERIS on \u00f0am forman case, and on \u00f0am o\u00f0rum fif casum \u00d0a naman, \u00fee weaxa\u00f0 on GENITIVVM, \u00fea",
